A file that isn't valid UTF-8 is reported; the TypeScript build decoded it with replacement
characters instead.
== args
input/latin1.md
input/ok.md
== file input/latin1.md escaped
# Caf\xe9
== file input/ok.md
# Ok
== stdout
input/ok.md
[L1-L1] # Ok
== stderr
FILE input/latin1.md IS NOT UTF-8 TEXT
== exit 1
